35,2,1,talk,Servas,,The staffing rolls are concerning. Many technicians have left for industry.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Sakura,,"The ledgers show shipping costs are up, but bench fees are subsidized.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,The closeout files show catalogue awards last longer than mechanism ones.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Takumi,,The spectroscopy suite was idle for eleven weeks last year.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Minako,,"The animal facility is accredited, but glasshouses are fully booked.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
