47,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,Awards with live breeding colonies overran schedules twice as often.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Takumi,,"One engineer covers three institutes, which is not sustainable.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Minako,,The glasshouse crew came through restructuring at full strength.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Servas,,"We have a gap in technical skills, but good modelling support.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Sakura,,"So computation is cheap, but physical space is tight.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,This suggests we should avoid projects dependent on live breeding.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Takumi,,"The infrastructure for data is ready, but for wet labs, it is shaky.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Minako,,We need to pick a project that fits the current capacity.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
